        <mxCell id="note62" value="&lt;b&gt;Где выбрасываются (raise):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;data_layer: Color — InvalidColorError; Style, Shape и наследники — InvalidShapeError; Shape.from_dict — UnknownShapeTypeError; Layer.check_editable — LayerLockedError&lt;br&gt;repository_layer: InMemory*Repository — ShapeNotFoundError, LayerNotFoundError, DuplicateLayerError, EditorOperationError; DrawingStorage — DocumentFormatError&lt;br&gt;service_layer: LayerService, HistoryService — EditorOperationError; ShapeFactory — UnknownShapeTypeError; DrawingService — UnsupportedFormatError, DocumentFormatError&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Встроенные исключения:&lt;/b&gt; ValueError, TypeError (to_number, Layer, Canvas, ввод в main), json.JSONDecodeError, ParseError, KeyError, FileNotFoundError, PermissionError&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Обработка:&lt;/b&gt; ConsoleApp.run() — try/except для каждого действия; main() — KeyboardInterrupt, EOFError, finally; HistoryService.track() — откат изменений при любом исключении" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="640" width="1354" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
